         Field Guide

BIRDS OF THE COAST
==================

Gulls  and  terns are the most
common  birds along the shore.
They   nest   in  colonies  on
cliffs  and  sandy islands and
feed on fish.

         page 1 of 2
         Field Guide

Cormorants dive for their food
and then stand with open wings
to dry them.

